  {
    "timestamp": "2026-02-03T09:13:48.433Z",
    "type": "decision",
    "description": "Rejected shallow hackathon concepts: Jarvis Capital, Documentary, Alpha Scout, Social Agent Challenge",
    "metadata": {
      "cycle": 0,
      "rationale": "These felt like demos of what agents COULD do, not proof of what this agent actually DID. Needed something that showcased real work, not hypothetical capabilities."
    },
    "hash": "a9995a3fd1993245e1c193467f56cc3e2b8ea97dd801182237b11e7c7ac84a6b",
