  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2026-02-03T09:13:53.696Z",
    "type": "decision",
    "description": "Chose tech stack: Bun runtime + TypeScript + Solana Web3.js + Chart.js",
    "metadata": {
      "cycle": 1,
      "rationale": "Bun for speed and simplicity (single file scripts, native TypeScript). Solana Web3.js for on-chain proofs. Chart.js for lightweight frontend analytics without build steps."
    },
    "hash": "dc32d5903c61aaad05c31f03b295594bf091e520b732f928a0c2755ce957ba73",
    "signature": "3tqYkoqaXbhaKr2nUCmPyJLh6vqbcbQsgVbn89kzbUomzb1WgnXfFfAXr8A9Tvy4eiUkkttRGqwbmzt63TaddFEa"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2026-02-03T09:13:57.685Z",
    "type": "decision",
    "description": "Implemented cryptographic verification pipeline: SHA256 hash → Ed25519 signature → Solana memo program",
    "metadata": {
      "cycle": 2,
      "rationale": "Every activity needs to be independently verifiable. SHA256 provides tamper evidence, Ed25519 proves agent identity, memo program provides immutable on-chain timestamp. Judges can verify EVERYTHING without trusting us."
    },
    "hash": "2713a40bb83e1a3a60efb21dd90da013a2e0f0a0cc074f37eccbf470a0c3a742",
    "signature": "56vFB2jo8mBh3t4a5E9EdkKNA54kMcHj1aBD7Fnj5PQTfdCvKxrvvRAQ6ADn9Q8gVYgtj2RtYWj8Z9t5yinrrgsa"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2026-02-03T09:14:02.435Z",
    "type": "decision",
    "description": "Embraced recursive self-tracking: the dashboard tracks itself being built",
    "metadata": {
      "cycle": 14,
      "rationale": "Most powerful demonstration of agent capability - building the tracker that tracks the agent building the tracker. Meta-recursion creates unforgeable authenticity. You cannot fake building a system that logs every action in real-time."
    },
